A new free Amiga game in 2018 by IceVAN from Purples Studios.
Uwol, Quest for money it's an Amiga port form the original 8 bits game of the
Mojon Twins.
Works with all Commodore Amiga computers with 1 Mb RAM.

Original game : The Mojon Twins
Amiga Code : IceVAN , Purples Studios
Amiga music : Fireboy
Graphics form Megadrive version : Shiru

IceVAN 2018.
